<div><img src="http://i.cnn.net/cnn/images/1.gif" width=634 height="9" hspace="0" vspace="0" alt="" border="0"></div>
<div class="cnnBodyText">
<p>To search CNN.com, enter your keyword/s at the top of this or any CNN.com page. To search any other site, click on a link below.</p>		
		


